id: GUIDE7-6
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: round_hint_counts
target: crates/core/src/begin.rs
find:     state.run.completed = false;
replace:     state.run.completed = false; state.hints_opened.clear();
expect-fail: s4_hint_counts_never_decrease_fixed_generation
expect-fail: s4_hint_counts_never_decrease_guided_generation
note: 周回の開始が前の周回のヒントの使用回数を消す
